```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Features Input] --> B{HR-1: Delivery +\nDevice Match?}
    B -->|Yes + goods_not_received| C[FORCE: Human Escalation]
    B -->|No| D{HR-2: Amount > $2500?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Block Auto-Resolve]
    D -->|No| F{HR-3: Member Rate\nz > 3.0?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Block Auto-Credit]
    F -->|No| H[Linear Scorecard\nz = SUM(wi * xi)]
    H --> I[p_scorecard = sigmoid(z)]
    I --> J[Monotonic Tree\np_model]
    J --> K{HR-4: |p_model -\np_scorecard| > 0.25?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Human Escalation]
    K -->|No| M[Platt Calibration\nconf = sigmoid(A*z + B)]
    M --> N{conf >= 0.85?}
    N -->|Yes + no rules + scorecard agree| O[AUTO RESOLVE]
    N -->|No| P{0.55 <= conf < 0.85?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[PROPOSED SPLIT]
    P -->|No| R[HUMAN ESCALATION]
    E --> R
    G --> R
    L --> R
```
